  "about": {
   "x": -620,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 520,
   "fill": "gray",
   "maxH": 900,
   "text": "Ki-Lo M3 diary screens (KEY-3).\nPorted from the boards Zee drew in the Ki-Lo Design System project (Claude Design, screens/*), with the M3 design audit applied (keylow-wt/design-briefs/m3/AUDIT-2026-10-15.md).\n\nRulings (Zee, 2026-10-15, KEY-62): four meal slots; one food at a time; slot by time of day; Targets under More, Nutrition; CalorieRing and MacroBars hero; suspect foods are copied before logging; delete with Undo, no confirm; copy yesterday on mobile, Copy to today per past day on web; web adds in a dialog.\n\nRecommendations applied overnight, for Zee to confirm: no \"+\" one-tap add on rows; an Undo toast auto-dismisses after 5 s; the manual target shows without \"(est.)\".\n\nEach board shows dark and light (mobile) or 1280 and 375 in both themes (web). Components on the right carry the state and theme tweaks."
  }
 },
